cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Open-Space results, code or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Open-Space: open, reproducible searches of public astronomical archives"
authors:
  - family-names: Wesney
    given-names: Matthew
abstract: >-
  Open-Space looks again at public data from telescopes and spacecraft to
  find what was missed. Each result includes its data receipts, the scripts
  to replay it, controls against false alarms and a statement of its limits.
repository-code: "https://github.com/dovvnloading/Open-Space"
url: "https://github.com/dovvnloading/Open-Space"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-11-15
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - archival data
  - reproducible research
  - open science
